 "mapping": {
  "author": "claude-mapper-B",
  "date": "2026-10-29",
  "draft_py": "# Goldvein Pick:\n#  \"Equipped creature gets +1/+1.\"                                   (compiled, kept)\n#  \"Whenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, create a Treasure token.\"\n#  \"Equip {1}\" (= {1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery. CR 702.6a)\nstatic_pt, equip = compiled\ntreasure = TokenSpec(   # the corpus' Treasure spec (M21 Gadrak, the Crown-Scourge)\n    name='Treasure',\n    type_line='Artifact',\n    types=('Artifact',),\n    subtypes=(),\n    power=None,\n    toughness=None,\n    keywords=(Keyword.TREASURE,),\n    abilities=(\n        ActivatedAbility(\n            cost=Cost(parts=(\n                CostSacrifice(target=Selector(\n                    count=QConst(value=1),\n                    mode=SelectorMode.CHOOSE,\n                    filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE),\n                    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n                )),\n                CostTap(),\n            )),\n            effect=A(Verb.ADD_MANA, {'amount': QConst(value=1), 'color': 'ANY', 'controller': ControllerRef.YOU}),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\n# \"to a player\": the damaged object is not a permanent (damage recipients are players,\n# creatures, planeswalkers, battles; only players are non-permanents). FAnd(()) would also\n# fire on combat damage dealt to a blocking/blocked creature.\ntrig = TriggeredAbility(\n    event=DamageDealtEvent(\n        amount=QUnbounded(),\n        filter=FNot(inner=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_PERMANENT)),\n        source=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_ATTACHED_TO_SOURCE),\n        combat=True,\n    ),\n    condition=None,\n    effect=A(Verb.CREATE_TOKEN, {'count': QConst(value=1), 'tokens': treasure}),\n)\nequip_sorcery = ActivatedAbility(cost=equip.cost, effect=equip.effect, timing=ActivationWindow.SORCERY)\nabilities = [static_pt, trig, equip_sorcery, SpellAbility(kind=SpellKind.ARTIFACT)]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "Equipped creature gets +1/+1.",
    "ir": "abilities[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Whenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, create a Treasure token.",
    "ir": "abilities[1]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Equip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)",
    "ir": "abilities[2] (timing=SORCERY) + keywords[0]"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "Trigger recipient filter FNot(IS_PERMANENT) = 'a player' (the only non-permanent damage recipient); the compiler's 'to a player' idiom FAnd(()) also fires on combat damage to a blocking creature (checked: pack_blocked gives a Treasure with FAnd(()), none with FNot(IS_PERMANENT)). Treasure TokenSpec copied from M21 Gadrak. Equip given timing=SORCERY (B5a-equip drops it). Carrier SpellAbility(ARTIFACT) added. Compiled card keyword TREASURE kept (G0 requires MTGJSON keywords; no executor reader)."
 },
